    "body": "https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1734870 and https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1767938 are some relevant changes here. Before the later one our `draggable` handling was completely busted IIUC. But yeah, I think flattened tree makes sense here...",
